      },
      {
        "text": "reach the zenith of one’s career",
        "en": "reach the zenith of one’s career",
        "ja": "キャリアの頂点に達する"
      },
      {
        "text": "the zenith of the sky",
        "en": "the zenith of the sky",
        "ja": "空の天頂"
      }
    ],
    "related": {
      "synonyms": [],
      "antonyms": []
    },
    "usage_note": "天文学では観測者の真上の点。比喩的には at its zenith（最盛期に）のように用いる。",
